  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "BulkFile: value conversion (FileValueConversionField of Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras 0.13.0) is applied in every path (list_file / submit_by_file / list_file_by_data / parse_file), with or without FileColumnMappingField. In the standard format the header stays 'Field.Value' and only the cell values are converted (FileValueConversionTransform); an external value not found in the conversion table is reported as 'Row N, Field.Value: code 'X' was not found in 'Module'.' together with the other row errors and the file is rejected as a whole; an empty (or whitespace-only) cell imports as null (a module that has a FileValueConversionField is imported through the same typed path as the column mapping, so an empty reference cell clears the reference on an Id-based update). Breaking: the code conversion of MappingColumn (ConversionModule etc.) is no longer applied. Requires Codeer.LowCode.Blazor.Extras 0.13.0.",
